{
  "name": "Arcane Sneak Attack",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you spend a Spell Slot to cast a spell of 1st level or higher that requires a spell attack roll, you can use your Sneak Attack on it, adhering to all other conditions as usual. If you do so, the damage die of your Sneak Attack increases to a d8 and its damage type to that of the spell.</p><p>Additionally, the cost of any Cunning Strike you use with such a spell is reduced by a number of dice equal to half the spell's level (rounded up).</p>",
